# Secrets & credentials (repo root has no .gitignore today)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/serviceAccountKey.json
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.key

# Dependencies & build artifacts (belt-and-suspenders)
**/node_modules/**
**/.next/**
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.venv/**
**/.poetry/**
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache/**

# Large runtime logs
**/logs/**

# Slide/podcast media (code lives outside these trees)

# Binary / media extensions anywhere in repo
**/*.wav
**/*.mp3
**/*.mp4
**/*.pdf
**/*.docx
**/*.xlsx
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.webp
**/*.woff
**/*.woff2

# Non-app root clutter (investor/proposal artifacts)
Asterix-*
BMJ-*
OSCE Guide - *
generate_*.py

# Huge lockfiles (low signal for most tasks; @mention if needed)
**/package-lock.json
**/poetry.lock
